# Level 1 flourish tour, for `scripts/record-run --capture` (format: src/capture/timeline.rs).
# Summon Giant Steps (5 toots, then Down calls the band), hop right through the nugget line (fired up; the even hops
# may also start a waltz), then into the pit a few times (wah-wah; the laughing band; the
# nervous band). ~60 s at any frame rate.

# Han's intro.
wait 4

# Five toots (jump, double-jump) charge Giant Steps; Down calls it.
repeat 5
  hold Space 140ms
  wait 120ms
  hold Space 140ms
  wait 0.9
end
tap Down
wait 4

# Hop right through the nugget line, up to the tall pillar.
repeat 6
  hold Right Space 300ms
  hold Right 450ms
end
wait 2

# Step back into the pit behind Nat: splat (wah-wah).
hold Left 1.2
wait 2.5

# Three more times from the start: hop to the pillar, step back into the pit (the laughing
# band at two deaths, the nervous band at three).
repeat 3
  repeat 6
    hold Right Space 300ms
    hold Right 450ms
  end
  hold Left 1.2
  wait 2.5
end

# Even hops in place, nervously: the band may waltz.
repeat 8
  hold Space 300ms
  wait 450ms
end
wait 4
